### Retries

A failed request is retried twice. The retry policy may be tuned with a [`retry`](7-retry.md#retry) options object.

```js
import got from 'got';

const options = {
	retry: {
		limit: 5,
		errorCodes: [
			'ETIMEDOUT'
		],
	},
};
```

Retries with stream are a little trickier, see [`stream.on('retry', …)`](3-streams.md#streamonretry-).
